&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:11.1pt;padding-right:11.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:11.1pt;padding-right:11.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;政策規制&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:5.4pt;padding-right:5.4pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;ＧＨＧ排出に関する規制強化&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="6" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:11.1pt;padding-right:11.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;1.5℃&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:11.1pt;padding-right:11.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:11.1pt;padding-right:11.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;リスク&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:11.7pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.6pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・炭素税が導入され、価格に転嫁&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:11.7pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-7.6pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・その結果、軽油など燃料費や、電力など動力費、車両調達費、協力会社への委託料など各コストが増加し、利益を圧迫する&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:11.1pt;padding-right:11.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:11.1pt;padding-right:11.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;大&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:11.1pt;padding-right:11.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:center;padding-left:11.1pt;padding-right:11.1pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;高&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12.1pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6.7pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・太陽光パネルの設置&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12.1pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6.7pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・再生可能エネルギー電力へ切り替え&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12.1pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6.7pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・従来に引き続き省エネ活動に取り組む&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12.1pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6.7pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・ハイブリッド車など即運用可能な低炭素車両の導入&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:12.1pt;padding-right:5.4pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-6.7pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;・低燃費タイヤへの切り替えなど、従来に引き続き省燃費活動に取り組む&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:48pt;min-height:48pt;"&gt;
