  <jpcrp_cor:NumberOfUnconsolidatedSubsidiariesAndAssociatesAccountedForUsingEquityMethodAndNamesOfMajorEntitiesAccountedForUsingEquityMethodTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;"&gt;(1) 持分法を適用した関連会社数　　1社&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;　持分法適用の関連会社&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:22.5pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:401.3pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
